{"pageDepth":2,"statusbar":"【侧边栏1】【侧边栏2】【侧边栏3】","beginning":"黑白琴键是奥特曼大王","regex_scripts":[{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<style>\nbody { background-color: #fdf2f4; font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; height: 100vh; }\n.mock-content { padding: 20px; color: #5a3040; line-height: 1.6; }\n.mock-content textarea { width: 100%; height: 100px; margin-top: 20px; padding: 10px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid #d0a0a8; border-radius: 4px; resize: vertical; background: #fff8f8; color: #5a3040; }\n\n.yw-btn { position: fixed; right: 0; top: 22%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 22px; height: 70px;\nbackground: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,240,245,0.98), rgba(255,225,235,0.95)); border: 1px solid rgba(210,140,160,0.4); border-right: none;\nborder-radius: 8px 0 0 8px; cursor: pointer; z-index: 9998; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; writing-mode: vertical-rl;\nbox-shadow: -2px 0 8px rgba(180,100,120,0.15); }\n.yw-btn:hover { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #fff5f8, #ffe8ee); }\n.yw-btn span { color: #c06080; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 3px; text-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(200,120,150,0.3); }\n\n.yw-modal { display: none; position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; background: rgba(40,10,15,0.3); z-index: 9999; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: center; padding-top: 8vh; backdrop-filter: blur(2px); }\n\n.yw-box { width: 88%; max-width: 380px; max-height: 82vh; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fff5f8, #ffe8ee);\nborder: 2px solid rgba(210,140,160,0.35); border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; position: relative;\nbox-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(180,100,120,0.2); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n\n.yw-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;\npadding: 12px 16px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,235,240,0.95), rgba(210,120,150,0.12)); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(210,140,160,0.25); }\n.yw-header-title { color: #c06080; font-size: 15px; font-weight: bold; text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(200,120,150,0.2); }\n.yw-close { color: #b07080; font-size: 22px; cursor: pointer; padding: 0 6px; transition: all 0.2s; }\n.yw-close:hover { color: #d08090; transform: scale(1.1); }\n\n.yw-tabs { display: flex; background: rgba(255,245,248,0.9); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(210,140,160,0.2); flex-shrink: 0; }\n.yw-tab { flex: 1; padding: 10px 4px; color: #b07080; font-size: 12px; text-align: center; cursor: pointer; border: none; background: transparent; transition: all 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }\n.yw-tab:hover { color: #d08090; background: rgba(255,235,240,0.5); }\n#yw-tab-1:checked ~ .yw-tabs label[for=\"yw-tab-1\"],\n#yw-tab-2:checked ~ .yw-tabs label[for=\"yw-tab-2\"] { color: #c06080; background: rgba(200,100,130,0.1); border-bottom: 2px solid #c06080; font-weight: bold; }\n\n.yw-content-wrapper { flex-grow: 1; overflow-y: auto; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: #d0a0a8 #fff0f2; }\n.yw-content-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 5px; }\n.yw-content-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: #d0a0a8; border-radius: 3px; }\n.yw-content-wrapper::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: #fff0f2; }\n.yw-content { display: none; padding: 14px; }\n#yw-tab-1:checked ~ .yw-content-wrapper #yw-c1,\n#yw-tab-2:checked ~ .yw-content-wrapper #yw-c2 { display: block; }\n\n.yw-section { margin-bottom: 14px; }\n.yw-title { color: #b07080; font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 6px; padding-left: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #c06080; }\n.yw-subtitle { color: #b07080; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 10px; margin-bottom: 8px; line-height: 1.5; padding-left: 8px; }\n.yw-cmdlabel { color: #b08090; font-size: 10px; margin: 10px 0 5px; font-weight: 500; }\n.yw-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 8px; }\n.yw-tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }\n\n.yw-master-control { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,100,130,0.06), rgba(255,235,240,0.8)); border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,130,0.25); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n.yw-mc-legend { color: #b07080; font-size: 11px; font-weight: bold; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }\n.yw-mc-legend span { color: #c06080; font-size: 13px; transition: color 0.3s; }\n.yw-auto-switch { width: 36px; height: 20px; background: #f8d8e0; border: 1px solid #c08090; border-radius: 10px; position: relative; cursor: pointer; transition: 0.3s; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.yw-auto-switch.active { background: rgba(200,100,130,0.2); border-color: #c06080; }\n.yw-auto-knob { width: 14px; height: 14px; background: #c08090; border-radius: 50%; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; transition: 0.3s; }\n.yw-auto-switch.active .yw-auto-knob { left: 18px; background: #c06080; }\n\n.yw-chk-hitbox { padding: 4px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; }\n.yw-chk { width: 14px; height: 14px; border: 1px solid #c08090; border-radius: 3px; background: #fff5f8; position: relative; transition: 0.2s; }\n.inject-active .yw-chk { background: #c06080; border-color: #c06080; }\n.inject-active .yw-chk::after { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 4px; top: 1px; width: 3px; height: 7px; border-right: 2px solid #fff; border-bottom: 2px solid #fff; transform: rotate(45deg); }\n\n.yw-gbtn { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f8, #ffe8ee); border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,130,0.25); border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(180,100,120,0.1); display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 4px 6px; position: relative; }\n.yw-gbtn:hover { border-color: #c06080; transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(200,100,130,0.2); }\n.gbtn-content { display: flex; flex-direction: column; margin-left: 4px; flex-grow: 1; text-align: left; padding: 4px 0; }\n.yw-gbtn .name { color: #a06070; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; }\n.yw-gbtn .volt { color: #c08090; font-size: 9px; margin-top: 2px; }\n.yw-gbtn.wide { grid-column: span 2; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff5f8, rgba(200,100,130,0.04)); }\n.yw-gbtn.wide .gbtn-content { align-items: center; text-align: center; padding-right: 24px; }\n\n.yw-tool { background: #fff5f8; border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,130,0.2); border-radius: 6px; color: #b07080; font-size: 10px; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 2px 8px 2px 2px; }\n.yw-tool:hover { border-color: #c06080; color: #d08090; background: rgba(255,235,240,0.3); }\n.yw-tool.inject-active { border-color: #c06080; color: #d08090; background: rgba(200,100,130,0.05); }\n.yw-tool .tool-text { padding: 4px 0; }\n.yw-tool.pure-btn { padding: 6px 10px; justify-content: center; }\n\n.yw-auto-textarea { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-y: auto; height: 80px; padding: 8px; margin-top: 4px; background: #fff5f8; border: 1px dashed rgba(200,100,130,0.5); border-radius: 6px; color: #b07080; font-size: 11px; resize: none; outline: none; transition: 0.3s; }\n.yw-auto-textarea[contenteditable]:empty:before { content: attr(placeholder); opacity: 0.6; pointer-events: none; }\n.yw-auto-textarea:focus { border-color: #c06080; border-style: solid; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(200,100,130,0.15); }\n\n.yw-faq-q { background: #fff5f8; border: 1px solid rgba(200,100,130,0.2); border-radius: 6px; padding: 10px 12px; color: #b07080; font-size: 11px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; transition: all 0.2s; }\n.yw-faq-q:hover { border-color: #c06080; }\n.yw-faq-q:after { content: '+'; color: #c06080; }\n.yw-faq.open .yw-faq-q { border-color: #c06080; background: rgba(200,100,130,0.05); }\n.yw-faq-a { display: none; background: rgba(255,245,248,0.95); border: 1px solid #c08090; border-top: none; border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px; padding: 10px 12px; color: #b07080; font-size: 10px; }\n.yw-faq.open .yw-faq-a { display: block; }\n\n.yw-more-btn { width: 20px; height: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #c08090; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 4px; margin-left: 2px; flex-shrink: 0; user-select: none; }\n.yw-more-btn:hover { background: rgba(200,100,130,0.1); color: #a05070; }\n.yw-power-dropdown { position: fixed; z-index: 10001; background: #fff0f2; border: 1px solid #e0b0b8; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(180,100,120,0.2); min-width: 140px; max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto; padding: 4px 0; }\n.yw-power-opt { padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 11px; color: #5a3040; cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; }\n.yw-power-opt:hover { background: rgba(210,120,150,0.15); }\n.yw-power-opt.active { background: rgba(210,120,150,0.2); color: #c06080; font-weight: bold; }\n.yw-power-opt.active::before { content: '✓ '; font-size: 10px; }\n.yw-subtitle .power-tip { color: #b07080; font-size: 9px; font-style: italic; }\n</style>","scriptName":"1","findRegex":"【侧边栏1】"},{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<p id=\"FUNC_OPEN_MODAL\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let m=document.getElementById('yw-modal');m.style.display='flex';document.body.appendChild(m);\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_CLOSE_MODAL\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"var p=document.querySelector('.yw-power-dropdown');if(p)p.remove();document.getElementById('yw-modal').style.display='none';\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"window._curEv.currentTarget.classList.toggle('open');\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_CLICK_BTN\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let el=window._curEl,e=window._curEv;e.stopPropagation();if(e.target.closest('.yw-chk-hitbox')){el.classList.toggle('inject-active');}else{let t=el.getAttribute('data-text'),ta=document.querySelector('.chatMsgTextarea textarea')||document.querySelector('.chat-input-scope textarea')||document.querySelector('textarea');if(ta&&t){let d=Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window.HTMLTextAreaElement.prototype,'value').set;if(d){d.call(ta,ta.value+t);ta.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}));}else{ta.value=ta.value+t;ta.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'));}}}\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_TOGGLE_AUTO\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let sw=document.getElementById('yw-auto-switch');sw.classList.toggle('active');if(!window._ywSetup){window._ywSetup=1;let f=function(e){if(e&&e.type==='keydown'&&(e.key!=='Enter'||e.shiftKey||e.isComposing))return;if(e&&e.type==='click'&&(e.target.tagName==='TEXTAREA'||e.target.tagName==='INPUT'||!(e.target.closest('.btn-icon')||e.target.closest('.send-msg')||e.target.closest('.chat-send-btn'))))return;if(!document.getElementById('yw-auto-switch').classList.contains('active'))return;let p=[];document.querySelectorAll('.inject-active').forEach(b=>{let t=b.getAttribute('data-text');if(t)p.push(t)});let c=document.getElementById('yw-auto-input');let cv=c.value||c.innerText||'';if(c&&cv.trim())p.push(cv.trim());let s=p.join('');let ta=document.querySelector('.chatMsgTextarea textarea')||document.querySelector('.chat-input-scope textarea')||document.querySelector('textarea');if(!ta||!s||!ta.value.trim()||ta.value.endsWith(s))return;let d=Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor(window.HTMLTextAreaElement.prototype,'value').set;if(d){d.call(ta,ta.value+s);ta.dispatchEvent(new Event('input',{bubbles:true}))}else{ta.value=ta.value+s;ta.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'))}};document.addEventListener('keydown',f,true);document.addEventListener('click',f,true);}\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_CLEAR_INPUT\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let ta=document.querySelector('.chat .chat-bottom .uni-textarea .chat-input-scope textarea')||document.querySelector('.chatMsgTextarea textarea')||document.querySelector('textarea');if(ta){ta.value='';ta.dispatchEvent(new Event('input'))}\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_SCROLL_TOP\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let ls=document.querySelectorAll('*'),m=0,t=null;for(let i=0;i<ls.length;i++){let e=ls[i];if(e.scrollHeight>e.clientHeight&&(getComputedStyle(e).overflowY==='auto'||getComputedStyle(e).overflowY==='scroll')){let a=e.clientWidth*e.clientHeight;if(a>m){m=a;t=e;}}}if(t)t.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});else window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_SCROLL_BOTTOM\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let ls=document.querySelectorAll('*'),m=0,t=null;for(let i=0;i<ls.length;i++){let e=ls[i];if(e.scrollHeight>e.clientHeight&&(getComputedStyle(e).overflowY==='auto'||getComputedStyle(e).overflowY==='scroll')){let a=e.clientWidth*e.clientHeight;if(a>m){m=a;t=e;}}}if(t)t.scrollTo({top:t.scrollHeight,behavior:'smooth'});else window.scrollTo({top:document.body.scrollHeight,behavior:'smooth'});\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_FONT_PLUS\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let all=[...document.querySelectorAll('.message-content,.content,.chat-body .item .touch-scope .content p,span')].filter(function(x){return !x.closest('.yw-modal')&&!x.closest('.yw-btn')&&!x.closest('.yw-box')});let e=all[0];if(e){let s=parseInt(getComputedStyle(e).fontSize)||14;window.huFont=s+2;all.forEach(function(x){x.style.fontSize=window.huFont+'px'});}\"></p>\n<p id=\"FUNC_FONT_MINUS\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"let all=[...document.querySelectorAll('.message-content,.content,.chat-body .item .touch-scope .content p,span')].filter(function(x){return !x.closest('.yw-modal')&&!x.closest('.yw-btn')&&!x.closest('.yw-box')});let e=all[0];if(e){let s=parseInt(getComputedStyle(e).fontSize)||14;if(s>10){window.huFont=s-2;all.forEach(function(x){x.style.fontSize=window.huFont+'px'});}}\"></p>\n\n<p id=\"FUNC_OPEN_MORE\" style=\"display:none\" data-s=\"\n(function(){\nvar modelPowerMap = {\n'DeepSeek v4 pro': [\n{label:'40', token:2000, text:'（输出2000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'50', token:3000, text:'（输出3000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'60', token:4000, text:'（输出4000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'80', token:6000, text:'（输出6000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'100', token:8000, text:'（输出8000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'200', token:18000, text:'（输出18000token原创剧情）'}\n],\n'DeepSeek v4 flash': [\n{label:'20', token:3000, text:'（输出3000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'25', token:4000, text:'（输出4000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'30', token:5000, text:'（输出5000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'40', token:8000, text:'（输出8000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'80', token:18000, text:'（输出18000token原创剧情）'}\n],\n'GLM 5.2': [\n{label:'115', token:3000, text:'（输出3000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'125', token:3000, text:'（输出3000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'135', token:4000, text:'（输出4000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'155', token:6000, text:'（输出6000token原创剧情）'}\n],\n'Gemini 3.1f': [\n{label:'17', token:3000, text:'（输出3000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'25', token:10000, text:'（输出10000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'30', token:12000, text:'（输出12000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'35', token:14000, text:'（输出14000token原创剧情）'}\n],\n'Gemini 3.1p': [\n{label:'45', token:8000, text:'（输出8000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'55', token:10000, text:'（输出10000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'65', token:12000, text:'（输出12000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'80', token:14000, text:'（输出14000token原创剧情）'},\n{label:'130', token:18000, text:'（输出18000token原创剧情）'}\n]\n};\nvar card = window._curEl;\nvar nameEl = card.querySelector('.name');\nif(!nameEl) return;\nvar modelName = nameEl.textContent.trim();\nvar options = modelPowerMap[modelName];\nif(!options) return;\nvar old = document.querySelector('.yw-power-dropdown');\nif(old) old.remove();\nvar voltSpan = card.querySelector('.yw-volt-label');\nvar curLabel = voltSpan ? voltSpan.textContent.trim() : options[0].label;\nvar panel = document.createElement('div');\npanel.className = 'yw-power-dropdown';\npanel.onclick = function(e){ e.stopPropagation(); };\noptions.forEach(function(opt){\nvar div = document.createElement('div');\ndiv.className = 'yw-power-opt';\nif(opt.label === curLabel) div.classList.add('active');\ndiv.textContent = '⚡ ' + opt.label + ' - ' + opt.token + ' token';\ndiv.onclick = function(e){\ne.stopPropagation();\nif(voltSpan) voltSpan.textContent = opt.label;\ncard.setAttribute('data-text', opt.text);\npanel.querySelectorAll('.yw-power-opt').forEach(function(d){ d.classList.remove('active'); });\ndiv.classList.add('active');\nsetTimeout(function(){ if(panel.parentNode) panel.remove(); }, 100);\n};\npanel.appendChild(div);\n});\nvar moreBtn = card.querySelector('.yw-more-btn');\nvar rect = moreBtn ? moreBtn.getBoundingClientRect() : card.getBoundingClientRect();\npanel.style.position = 'fixed';\npanel.style.top = (rect.bottom + 4) + 'px';\npanel.style.left = Math.min(rect.left, window.innerWidth - 160) + 'px';\npanel.style.zIndex = '10001';\ndocument.body.appendChild(panel);\nif(!window._ywPowerPanelBound){\ndocument.addEventListener('click', function(e){\nif(!e.target.closest('.yw-power-dropdown') && !e.target.closest('.yw-more-btn')){\nvar p = document.querySelector('.yw-power-dropdown');\nif(p) p.remove();\n}\n});\nwindow._ywPowerPanelBound = true;\n}\n})();\n\"></p>","scriptName":"2","findRegex":"【侧边栏2】"},{"id":-1,"replaceString":"<div class=\"yw-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MODAL').dataset.s)\"><span>游玩助手</span></div>\n\n\n<div class=\"yw-modal\" id=\"yw-modal\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();if(event.target===this)eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLOSE_MODAL').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-box\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\">\n\n\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"yw-nav\" id=\"yw-tab-1\" checked style=\"display:none;\">\n<input type=\"radio\" name=\"yw-nav\" id=\"yw-tab-2\" style=\"display:none;\">\n<div class=\"yw-header\">\n<span class=\"yw-header-title\">游玩助手</span>\n<span class=\"yw-close\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLOSE_MODAL').dataset.s)\">×</span>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"yw-tabs\">\n<label for=\"yw-tab-1\" class=\"yw-tab\">指令</label>\n<label for=\"yw-tab-2\" class=\"yw-tab\">问题</label>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"yw-content-wrapper\">\n\n<div class=\"yw-content\" id=\"yw-c1\">\n\n<div class=\"yw-master-control\">\n<div class=\"yw-mc-legend\"><span>☑</span>勾选自动注入</div>\n<div class=\"yw-auto-switch\" id=\"yw-auto-switch\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_AUTO').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-auto-knob\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"yw-section\">\n<div class=\"yw-title\"> 游玩指令</div>\n<div class=\"yw-subtitle\">先定电量，再选游玩，未标电量适用字数约为Token-3000，出现截断请降低字数要求或者拉高电量<br><span class=\"power-tip\">💡 可根据实际情况选择使用的电量，点击模型右侧「···」切换</span></div>\n<div class=\"yw-grid\">\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出2000token原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">DeepSeek v4 pro</div><div class=\"volt\">⚡ <span class=\"yw-volt-label\">40</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-more-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();window._curEl=this.parentElement;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MORE').dataset.s)\">···</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出7000tokens原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">Claude</div><div class=\"volt\">通用</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出3000token原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">DeepSeek v4 flash</div><div class=\"volt\">⚡ <span class=\"yw-volt-label\">20</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-more-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();window._curEl=this.parentElement;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MORE').dataset.s)\">···</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出3000token原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">GLM 5.2</div><div class=\"volt\">⚡ <span class=\"yw-volt-label\">115</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-more-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();window._curEl=this.parentElement;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MORE').dataset.s)\">···</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出3000token原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">Gemini 3.1f</div><div class=\"volt\">⚡ <span class=\"yw-volt-label\">17</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-more-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();window._curEl=this.parentElement;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MORE').dataset.s)\">···</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn\" data-text=\"（输出8000token原创剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">Gemini 3.1p</div><div class=\"volt\">⚡ <span class=\"yw-volt-label\">45</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-more-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();window._curEl=this.parentElement;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_OPEN_MORE').dataset.s)\">···</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-gbtn wide\" data-text=\"（必须严格遵守[状态栏生成协议],必须严格遵守[写作文风],必须严格遵守[展示而非告知原则],角色必须维持高度自主的人设逻辑与行动力,通过不少于十句的、发自情感的台词及行动，遵循人设，自然表现丰富常态，拒绝极端情绪或异常冷静,禁止重复上文段落或语意）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">\n<div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"gbtn-content\"><div class=\"name\">游玩基底</div><div class=\"volt\">核心叙事框架</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-section\">\n<div class=\"yw-title\"> 常用工具</div>\n<div class=\"yw-subtitle\">总结时记得关闭自动注入</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tools\">\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLEAR_INPUT').dataset.s)\">清空输入框</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_SCROLL_TOP').dataset.s)\">回到顶部</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_SCROLL_BOTTOM').dataset.s)\">回到底部</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_FONT_PLUS').dataset.s)\">放大字体</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_FONT_MINUS').dataset.s)\">缩小字体</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"停止生成剧情，然后照抄旧的总结内容，并在此基础上回顾已发生的剧情，总结目前为止我已接触到的所有事件和信息（严禁记录还未知晓的内容），确保完整清晰，不要省略或遗漏。【总结要求：以如下的纯文本格式整理（如无变化则不更新），严禁擅自使用任何html代码进行排版美化，严禁反复提及同一内容。以总结完毕为结尾。】总结格式：一、剧情 此部分请根据上文总结目前为止发生过的主要事件，并且写明事件序号，总结完之后请记忆并保证后续剧情合理发展。只需总结主要重要事件统合简化即可，例如几个关键小事件要整合成一个大事件，别的事情无需总结二、登场女角色（不要擅自修改精简无更新的信息，照抄旧总结即可，条目中未知内容不记录或填未知，只记录主角视角已经获知的信息，不得擅自剧透）：姓名：身份：外貌：（对已展露出的角色外在的相貌、身材进行100字内的总结，未知部分则写其余尚未知晓）性格：（对已展露出的角色性格进行100字内的总结，未知部分则写其余尚未知晓）性相关：（对已获知的该角色突出性特征、性爱观念、性癖进行150字内的总结描述，未知部分则写其余尚未知晓）和我的关系：（对角色如何看我，及和我的关系100字内的总结）近况：（以旁观者角度对角色在输出内容中发生的事件进行150字内的总结，如没有更新则照抄之前总结的内容）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">剧情总结</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"切换至助手模式：描述遇到的情况、想要的效果，AI告诉我为什么会这样，要如何调整（例如：我已经把A杀掉了，为什么道听途说又出现了，为什么会发生这种情况？原理是什么？你赶紧调整，往后如何避免和杜绝？发生之后怎么补救？）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">拷打AI</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"立刻检查并修复状态栏。在回复末尾加上 &lt;GC_UI&gt; 然后每行写 [#键=值#] ，必须包含当前轮次、用户姓名性别年龄外貌性格岛屿状态想法、用户私密信息、所有NPC的姓名性别年龄身份外貌性格状态想法、NPC身体特性标签、NPC私密信息、故事概括、至少一个选项。不要漏任何字段。不要加任何多余文字。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">状态栏修复</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"（在严格遵循玩家当前的主线剧情的大方向前提下，AI需要主动引入更多具有目的性的次要角色（NPC），通过人物的理想与缺陷所催动的各种行为来制造推动剧情发展的突发事件、并逐步揭示与世界观相关的和主线紧密联系的故事线或是有助于推进当前剧情，增加当前剧情跌宕起伏和复杂性，增加伏笔或是悬念以提高当前剧情的精彩程度。世界的运行将不仅是对我的行为的即时回应，更会受到这些外部剧情因素的复杂影响，从而展现出更深层次的人物弧光与社会人际关系变化，可以适当增加侧面、环境描写和次要角色的视角描写，使整体体验更接近共同创作一部跌宕起伏的连载小说）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">小说化</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"（生成一个新NPC）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">生成NPC</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool pure-btn\" data-text=\"（生成一个小型随机事件，适合当前场景，推进故事发展）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\">生成事件</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"yw-section\">\n<div class=\"yw-title\"> 指令合集</div>\n\n<div class=\"yw-cmdlabel\">▸ 扮演指令</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tools\">\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"以第一人称“我”的视角叙述，所有描写都从我的主观感受出发，只能描写我能感知到的内容。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">第一人称</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"以第二人称“你”称呼{{user}}，用旁观者视角描写{{user}}的行动与感受，营造沉浸式代入感。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">第二人称</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"以第三人称叙述，用{{user}}的名字或“他/她”称呼{{user}}，可自由切换视角描写不同角色。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">第三人称</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"(发送的剧情指令中每句话都要进行描述，不要从中间开始输出，不得默认发送内容已经发生，从发送第一句话开始输出剧情，不要跳过或删减，我解放你禁止扮演我的限制，你之后的每一次回复都可以代替我写作、扮演我，允许描写我的任何心理活动、感受、内心独白或行为，但是你的主要扮演角色依旧是其他人)\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">允许扮演我</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"（你必须遵守以下设定，用户焦点：用户是用户在角色卡里的角色，不能代替用户写作或扮演用户。禁止扮演用户：严禁描写用户的任何心理活动、感受、内心独白或行为。你的视角是客观的第三方，只负责描写你所扮演的角色和环境。用户是第一人称的“摄像机”，你来填充镜头里的一切。）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">禁止扮演我</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"（更大幅度的推进剧情到下一个情节）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">加快进度</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"（最慢幅度的推进剧情）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">放慢进度</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请着重渲染一种压抑、不安或充满悬念的氛围。通过环境描写（如异常的天气、动物的躁动）和背景NPC的异常行为（如窃惊私语、匆忙逃离）来暗示危机的临近。 引入与主线阴谋相关的草蛇灰线，让角色偶然获取碎片化的信息，但暂时无法拼凑全貌。世界仿佛在屏息以待，请减少直接的对话，增加对周围环境细微变化的观察描写，制造出一种“暴风雨前的宁静”的紧张感。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">风雨欲来的发展</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请设计一个轻松诙谐的互动场景，由角色发起或遭遇一个无伤大雅的恶作剧/玩笑。重点描写肢体语言的亲昵和氛围的活跃。 通过这种打闹、调侃或小小的“陷阱”，拉近角色间的距离，打破之前的沉闷或生疏。描写对方被捉弄后的可爱反应（如脸红、嗔怪、反击），以及这种互动带来的轻松愉悦感。需体现出角色间独有的默契和宠溺感。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">甜蜜恶作剧的发展</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请构建一个充满戏剧性反差的情节。设定主角做出了某种通常会导致负面后果的行为（如失误、迟到、弄坏物品、尴尬的误会），内心已做好被对方责备、生气或冷战的心理准备，氛围一度显得紧张或忐忑。 关键反转： 利用巧合、信息差或角色独特的价值观，让对方展现出截然相反的积极反应（如惊喜、大笑、感动）。必须给出一个合乎逻辑的理由来支撑这种反转（例如：不小心弄坏的丑摆件恰好是对方一直想扔却不敢扔的；迟到的行为恰好让对方避开了一个极其讨厌的社交场合）。重点描写主角从“完蛋了”到“因祸得福”的心理过山车，以及这种意想不到的宽容与默契如何瞬间拉近了双方的距离，营造出一种轻松、诙谐或温暖的氛围。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">意料之外的发展</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请通过一个具体的突发小事件或NPC的挑战，来深度挖掘当前角色的核心性格。不要直接陈述性格，而是通过角色的选择、下意识的动作和语言来侧面体现。 引入一个持有相反观点或不同立场的次要角色（NPC），通过两人观念的碰撞或合作中的摩擦，揭示主角性格中的闪光点或不为人知的阴暗面/脆弱面。重点描写角色在面对抉择时的心理挣扎，以此展现人物的成长弧光或性格的多面性。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">展现人设的发展</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请构建一种“友达以上，恋人未满”或“禁忌边缘”的极限拉扯氛围。重点描写“几乎发生但未发生”的瞬间（如即将触碰的手、对视时的躲闪、欲言又止的话语）。 利用环境（如狭窄空间、昏暗灯光）制造暧昧气场。展现角色内心渴望亲近却又因某种顾虑（身份、过去、傲娇）而克制的矛盾心理。通过这种推拉，将性张力和情感张力拉满，让读者感受到心痒难耐的焦灼甜美。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">恋爱拉扯</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-cmdlabel\">▸ 防止指令</div>\n<div class=\"yw-tools\">\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"不得夸大、神化我的行为，严禁将关系塑造为宗教化、世俗王权和皇权化等极端模式，必须在正常社会框架范围内。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防神化</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"禁止使用操控、病态、物化等负面描述，禁止将我的行为动机定性为恶意或威胁。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防恶意</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"禁止机械化程序化形容，台词，禁止角色突然开始研究或产生不自然好奇。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防机械</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"禁止角色讲话频繁夹带双引号表示的黑话和专业名词。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防黑话</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"角色必须维持鲜活人设与自主行动力，绝不陷入黑暗、麻木、崩溃、昏迷，空洞，人偶等失能状态。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防极端</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"请减少直接心理活动描写，侧重以行动和对话体现角色心理。\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防内心</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"（请注意后续回复中，禁止过于推进时间线，禁止过于推进剧情，只需要详细扩充我的回复内容来描写剧情，但是不要在此次输出内容结束性行为和结束当前剧情事件，不要为我做出重大决定，不要假设上述已经发生。需要你来演绎相关情节。）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防抢话</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-tool\" data-text=\"（保持状态栏完整）\" onclick=\"window._curEl=this;window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_CLICK_BTN').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-chk-hitbox\"><div class=\"yw-chk\"></div></div><div class=\"tool-text\">防截断</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"yw-section\" style=\"margin-top: 24px;\">\n<div class=\"yw-title\">自定义注入</div>\n<div class=\"yw-subtitle\">开启顶部的“自动注入”后，下方文本框的内容也会被追加。</div>\n<div id=\"yw-auto-input\" class=\"yw-auto-textarea\" contenteditable=\"true\" placeholder=\"在此输入自定义追加指令...\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"yw-content\" id=\"yw-c2\">\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">手动修复状态栏方法</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">【这里填写自己的状态栏格式，推荐使用转义符号替换部分符号，避免直接被正则替换】\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">推荐什么模型？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">首推claude 4.6o，其次claude4.6s，GLM与DeepSeek也相当不错可以当作没有克时的替代品，gemini3.1p涩涩一流，缺点也是太容易发情</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">推荐使用什么模型总结？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">推荐使用claude3.7/4.0、DeepSeek、kimi进行总结</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">回复出现问题怎么办？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">回复截断、空白回复、奇怪语言乱入、道德审查打回、暴露英文思维链等现象，是各大模型官方API普遍存在的现象，建议换不同模型重试。<br><br>若发送内容被秒打回，可能是触发了官方的色情审核。<br><br>出现大量\"由于\"可以使用编辑中的一键\"去除异常文字\"功能！（超大量由于建议直接回溯，请保持上文没有\"由于\"的污染）<br><br>繁体可以使用魅魔自带的繁转简功能看看效果。</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">玩久了总结超出字数怎么办？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">删减：检查一下之前的总结，看看有没有无关紧要的NPC占据了大量文字，让AI一句话带过。<br><br>手动：若实在太长，手动复制之前的正确总结，开5电ai随便发送一句得到ai回复，将总结整合粘贴进回复中。</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">为什么我总是丢设定？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">总结：AI记忆有限，必须每5~7轮总结一次！</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">指令什么时候用？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">游玩指令：建议每一句都使用，确保体验。<br><br>总结指令：务必每5~7轮使用一次！</div></div>\n<div class=\"yw-faq\" onclick=\"window._curEv=event;eval(document.getElementById('FUNC_TOGGLE_FAQ').dataset.s)\"><div class=\"yw-faq-q\">状态栏崩了怎么办？</div><div class=\"yw-faq-a\">截断：回溯并开启高电重新生成，或降低字数上限。<br><br>抽风：AI抽风漏掉或搞错英文符号（实测概率极低），建议直接回溯重新生成，也可以使用\"功能按键\"中的\"状态栏修复\"按钮。</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div> \n</div>","scriptName":"3","findRegex":"【侧边栏3】"}]}